type: dataset
title: "Classifier Cost Exhibit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Clouatre"
    given-names: "Hugues"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4291-1999"
    affiliation: "Université de Bordeaux"
repository-code: https://github.com/clouatre-labs/classifier-cost-exhibit
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-11-15"
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >
  Pre-registered evaluation on the UCI SECOM dataset testing whether the
  accuracy-optimal classifier misses more defects than a lower-accuracy
  alternative under an explicit error-cost matrix, and whether a
  cost-aligned decision threshold (p* = FP/(FP+FN)) reverses the ranking.
keywords:
  - machine-learning
  - cost-sensitive-learning
  - imbalanced-data
  - pre-registered-experiment
  - reproducibility
